# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
.valid {
  --theme: red;
  @supports ("--theme": blue) and ("--theme": green) {
    --theme: blue;
  }
}

@supports ("--theme": green) {
  .invalid {
    --theme: red;
    --theme: blue;
  }
}

```

